WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Crumbling Memory Archive - Sector Gamma, tense.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.300 align:center
Lyra: No! Not this one.

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.600 align:center
Kael: Falling. Always falling.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:09.900 align:center
Lyra: Move! Now!

5
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.200 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Narrow Memory-Corridor, precariously suspended, urgent.

6
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:16.500 align:center
Lyra: Get back!

7
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:17.800 align:center
Echo Shard: Unnecessary. Release it.

8
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.100 align:center
Lyra: Mine. Not yours.

9
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:20.400 align:center
Kael: Its hunger… familiar.

10
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:26.700 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The Void's Edge, below the archive, desperate.

11
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.000 align:center
Lyra: No! Kael!

12
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.300 align:center
Kael: Again… the drift.

13
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:30.600 align:center
Lyra: Got you!

14
00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:32.900 align:center
Echo Shard: Futile. It will return.

15
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:40.200 align:center
♪ at dawn, in A brief 'safe' pocket within the memory archive, rapidly being consumed, dread.

16
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.500 align:center
Lyra: Fracturing… hold on, Kael.

17
00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.800 align:center
Kael: The weave… it tightens.

18
00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:47.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: All threads return. Eventually.

19
00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.400 align:center
Lyra: What is that thing?

20
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:54.700 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in A labyrinth of crystalline memory-structures, tense.

21
00:00:54.1000 --> 00:00:55.1000 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Your struggle… unnecessary.

22
00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:57.300 align:center
Lyra: Almost!

23
00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:59.600 align:center
Kael: They preserve… by consuming.

24
00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:01.900 align:center
Lyra: What did you say?

25
00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:07.200 align:center
♪ at dusk, in A collapsing memory-chamber, tendrils everywhere, desperate.

26
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.500 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Resistance is… inefficient.

27
00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:09.800 align:center
Lyra: Can't… breathe!

28
00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:12.100 align:center
Kael: It will take… everything.

29
00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.400 align:center
Lyra: Not this. Not you.

30
00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:20.700 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A rapidly dissolving bridge of memory-fragments, dread.

31
00:01:20.1000 --> 00:01:21.1000 align:center
Lyra: It's collapsing!

32
00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:23.300 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Come. Be whole.

33
00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:25.600 align:center
Kael: This path… I walked it.

34
00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:26.900 align:center
Lyra: You were… absorbed?

35
00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:34.200 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A shrinking, spherical memory-chamber, Loom tendrils closing in, desperate.

36
00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:36.500 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Rest now. Be remembered.

37
00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:38.800 align:center
Lyra: No! Not like this!

38
00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:41.100 align:center
Kael: Use it. Burn it.

39
00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:42.400 align:center
Lyra: But… you'll fade.

40
00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:47.700 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The rapidly collapsing memory-sphere, desperate.

41
00:01:47.1000 --> 00:01:48.1000 align:center
Lyra: Forgive me, Kael.

42
00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:50.300 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: A futile… burst.

43
00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:51.600 align:center
Kael: Live. Remember me.

44
00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:52.900 align:center
Lyra: I will!

45
00:01:54.200 --> 00:02:01.200 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The swirling rift created by the shard, Loom tendrils still probing, dread.

46
00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:02.500 align:center
Lyra: Hold! Hold!

47
00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:04.800 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: The path is… known.

48
00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:07.100 align:center
Kael: Our first laugh… gone.

49
00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:08.400 align:center
Lyra: No! Not that!

50
00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:15.700 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A desolate, temporary 'safe zone' between memory-worlds, desperate.

51
00:02:15.1000 --> 00:02:16.1000 align:center
Lyra: Safe… for now.

52
00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:19.300 align:center
Kael: It remembers… my path.

53
00:02:19.600 --> 00:02:20.600 align:center
Lyra: What path?

54
00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:22.900 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: The next archive… awaits your arrival.
